      {
        "string_va": "0x142BB5330",
        "value": "\n.. gcmd:function:: manual-cam(query=False, enable=None, translation=None, rotation=None, aim=None)\n\n\tInteract with the manual camera\n\n\t.. note:: You cannot get/set the transform information unless the camera is enabled.\n\t\n\tThe result from query looks something like this::\n\t\t\n\t\t{'is_manual_cam': True,\n\t\t 'process': 'CameraControlManual-13',\n\t\t 'rotation': [0.0, 180.0, 0.0],\n\t\t 'translation': [1.49, 0.0, 54.6]}\n\n\t:param bool query: The current game/manual camera information is returned as a map\n\t:param bool enable: Enable/Disable the manual camera\n\t:param list translation: Set the translation of the manual camera\n\t:param list rotation: \n\t\tSet the rotation of the manual camera\n\t\t(degree's XYZ rotation order)\n\t:param list aim: \n\t\tchange the camera to aim in a direction [X, Y, Z]\n\t\t(Does not work if 'rotation' is passed)\n\t:return: Camera state or camera information\n\t:rtype: bool or map\n\t:author: Nathan Horne\n\t\n",
        "xrefs": [
