    "process-list": [
      {
        "string_va": "0x142BB39F0",
        "value": "\n.. gcmd:function:: process-list()\n\n\tList the current processes in-game as well as basic information for each.\n\n\tEach process info Map has the following information:\n\t\t\n\t\t* process: The process name\n\t\t* nameid: The process name id\n\t\t* object-type-id: The process class (SID)\n\t\t* pid: The process integer id\n\t\t* selected: true/false object is in *debug* selection\n\t\t* [Optional]state-id: The process state name if any (SID)\n\t\t* [Optional]spawner-id: The spawner that spawned this process (SID)\n\t\n\t:return: List of process info map's\n\t:rtype: list\n\t:author: Nathan Horne\n\n",
